    {
      "bbox": [
        246,
        929,
        1816,
        1231
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Legislature has adjourned and approximately 900 bills are before the Governor for executive action. About 250 to 300 of these bills affect the City. They are referred to appropriate City agencies for analysis and recommendations by my Legislative Representative in Albany.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2915,
          "min": -1.4192
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 56,
          "mean": -0.0007,
          "min": -0.0263
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 26872,
        "area_px": 469259,
        "density": 0.05726,
        "chars": 276,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.27
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        239,
        1269,
        1882,
        2093
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Bills which are now before the Governor are \"thirty day bills\". This means that the Governor has thirty days in which to approve or disapprove such bills. It does not mean that the City has thirty days in which to submit its recommendations to the Governor on bills affecting the City. It is essential, therefore, that City Agencies submit their reports on such bills within 72 hours after receipt of notice that a particular bill is before the Governor. In this way, I shall have the benefit of your advice and be in a position to make timely recommendations to the Governor. Time is of the essence especially with respect to bills which would adversely affect the Administration or Government of the City.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3156,
          "min": -1.5906
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 139,
          "mean": -0.0039,
          "min": -0.5232
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 70938,
        "area_px": 1335750,
        "density": 0.05311,
        "chars": 707,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.97
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229,
        2131,
        1928,
        2447
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Delay in replying to requests for reports on bills before the Governor may prove detrimental to the best interests of the City. Accordingly, I anticipate and shall appreciate your prompt consideration in replying to requests for recommendations on bills before the Governor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2829,
          "min": -1.4028
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
